# package-lock.json is deliberately NOT ignored. It pins the tree that runs
# with CloudFormation deploy credentials, and an unpinned tree is re-resolved
# on every machine. It carries one third-party email address — npm's copy of
# glob@10.5.0's published deprecation notice — which the secret scan forgives
# by exact string in tests/hygiene/test_repo_hygiene.py.
